# SharedOllama Cursor Routing

- Treat [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) as the repository-level architecture and workflow baseline.
- Prefer the local `ollama-worker` skill for one-file changes, one function or method, focused tests, small scripts, regex, and documentation edits.
- Load [skills/ollama-worker/SKILL.md](../../skills/ollama-worker/SKILL.md) before using the local worker workflow.
- Use [skills/ollama-worker/scripts/call_ollama.py](../../skills/ollama-worker/scripts/call_ollama.py) and [skills/ollama-worker/scripts/apply_op.py](../../skills/ollama-worker/scripts/apply_op.py) for local model delegation and FILE_OP application.
- Keep local delegation bounded and review the diff before accepting it.
- Do not escalate to cloud reasoning for routine bounded edits when the local worker can handle the task.
